      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: apologies for the delay. I've updated avtr_29f036dc-1fe6-459c-85e0-09b9a57c392a to replicate the issue.\nThere's also avtr_e6b76078-d4ac-49f6-a329-5fafcef15eaa--as opposed to avtr_e252df4e-fa6f-4f5b-866b-2bc1747cc765 where the issue has been rectified by simply moving EyeProxy to the parent of RightEye--with the issue persisting.",
